{'symbol': 'FI', 'date': '2023-06-27 02:30:00', 'title': 'TATA MOTORS FINANCE ELEVATES AND SIMPLIFIES DIGITAL LENDING CAPABILITIES WITH FISERV', 'text': "MUMBAI, INDIA--(BUSINESS WIRE)--TATA MOTORS FINANCE LIMITED (TMFL), ONE OF INDIA'S LEADING AUTOMOTIVE FINANCIERS, IS FORTIFYING ITS DIGITAL LENDING CAPABILITIES AND ENABLING TOP-NOTCH CUSTOMER EXPERIENCES THROUGH A NEW PARTNERSHIP WITH FISERV, INC. (NYSE: FI), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF PAYMENTS AND FINANCIAL SERVICES TECHNOLOGY SOLUTIONS. TO ADVANCE ITS DIGITAL STRATEGY AND KEEP PACE WITH RAPIDLY CHANGING CUSTOMER EXPECTATIONS, TATA MOTORS FINANCE HAS IMPLEMENTED FIRSTVISION™ FROM FISERV, A."}